   "source": [
    "# The Figure and Axes model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5cb48a2e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "This is the most important concept in Matplotlib. Most tutorials skip it and then beginners get confused when they try to customize charts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "84288791",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- A Figure is an entire Canvas"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "38b20ae8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- An Axex is one individual plot on that Canvas"
   ]
  },
